{
  "slug": "content-intelligence",
  "name": "Content Intelligence",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Competitive ad intelligence inside Claude and other AI agents — discover brands, build knowledge sets, analyze content, coach creators, vet influencers, and run audience deep-dives powered by Adology's data platform.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills**, **1 agent**, **4 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `audience-deep-dive` (Build a rich, behaviorally grounded audience profile that goes well beyond demographics — surfacing the fears, desires, jobs-to-be-done,…), `brand-builder` (Builds out a portfolio's tracked universe and the project scopes analysis reads from), `brand-marketing-mode` (Activates Brand Marketing Mode for Adology — a way of thinking about content and brands that blends what…), `brand-partnership-vetting` (Vet, score, and shortlist brand co-marketing partners using content intelligence), `content-strategist` (Turns competitive creative data into briefable creative direction), `creative-toolkit` (Builds a living creative toolkit for a campaign or brand — a curated library of hooks, angles, copy…), `data-explorer` (Guides querying, filtering, and curation across a project's scope), `getting-started` (Introduces Adology's competitive and audience intelligence platform), and 6 more\n- **Agents** (1): `deep-analyst` (Multi-pass competitive intelligence analyst)\n- **Commands** (4): `analyze` (Analyze a brand or topic across a project's tracked scope), `compare` (Head-to-head comparison of two brands or topics), `discover` (Find brands and creators worth tracking, and add them to a portfolio), `export` (Turn a scoped read into a table or CSV, with honest coverage)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `adology`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install content-intelligence@claude-community` from `adologyai/content-intelligence-plugin`.",
